@startuml
title FanPulse — Proposed Agent Framework Workflow with Decision-1

autonumber

actor Viewer

box "Browser" #EDE7F6
participant "React Application" as React
participant "Video Player" as Video
end box

box "Azure App Service" #E3F2FD
participant "FastAPI" as API
participant "WebSocket Broadcaster" as WS
end box

box "Microsoft Agent Framework Workflow" #E8F5E9
participant "Vision Executor" as VisionExecutor <<Executor>>
participant "Match Analyst Node" as AnalystNode <<Agent Node>>
participant "Moment Decision Executor" as DecisionExecutor <<Executor>>
participant "Fan Engagement Node" as EngagementNode <<Agent Node>>
participant "Policy Executor" as PolicyExecutor <<Executor>>
participant "Broadcast Executor" as BroadcastExecutor <<Executor>>
end box

box "Microsoft Foundry" #FFF3E0
participant "GPT-5-mini" as Vision <<Model>>
participant "Match Analyst" as Analyst <<Agent>>
participant "Microsoft-Decision-1" as Decision <<Model>>
participant "Fan Engagement" as Engagement <<Agent>>
end box

database "Cosmos DB" as Cosmos

Viewer -> Video: Press Play
activate Video

loop Approximately one frame per second
    Video -> React: Current video frame and timestamp
    React -> React: Add frame to rolling buffer
end

React -> API: Submit five-frame window\nwith timestamps and viewer mode
API -> VisionExecutor: Start workflow turn

group Immediate vision path
    VisionExecutor -> Vision: Send ordered JPEG frames
    activate Vision
    Vision --> VisionExecutor: Structured visible observation
    deactivate Vision

    VisionExecutor -> BroadcastExecutor: Direct insight event
    BroadcastExecutor -> WS: Publish immediate insight
    WS -> React: vision_result
    React -> React: Display latest insight
end

note over React,VisionExecutor
Video playback and immediate insights
remain independent of the remaining workflow.
end note

group Background decision workflow
    VisionExecutor -> AnalystNode: Structured observation
    AnalystNode -> Analyst: Assess football significance
    activate Analyst
    Analyst --> AnalystNode: Assessment, rationale,\nuncertainty and score
    deactivate Analyst

    AnalystNode -> DecisionExecutor: Observation + assessment

    note right of DecisionExecutor
    Executor builds bounded questions:
    • Is it grounded?
    • How significant is it?
    • Should engagement be created?
    end note

    DecisionExecutor -> Decision: Decision API request\nwith structured JSON
    activate Decision
    Decision --> DecisionExecutor: Calibrated probabilities
    deactivate Decision

    alt Grounded and poll probability exceeds thresholds
        DecisionExecutor -> EngagementNode: PollApproved event
        EngagementNode -> Engagement: Observation + assessment\n+ decision + viewer mode
        activate Engagement
        Engagement --> EngagementNode: Audience-specific poll
        deactivate Engagement

        EngagementNode -> PolicyExecutor: Poll candidate
        PolicyExecutor -> PolicyExecutor: Enforce cooldown,\ndeduplication and expiry
        PolicyExecutor -> Cosmos: Store decision and poll
        PolicyExecutor -> BroadcastExecutor: PublishPoll event
        BroadcastExecutor -> WS: Deliver poll
        WS -> React: Significant moment and poll
        React -> React: Animate poll beneath insight
    else Insight only
        DecisionExecutor -> PolicyExecutor: InsightOnly event
        PolicyExecutor -> Cosmos: Store decision outcome
    else Suppressed or insufficiently grounded
        DecisionExecutor -> PolicyExecutor: Suppressed event
        PolicyExecutor -> Cosmos: Store decision outcome
    end
end

Viewer -> React: Submit vote
React -> API: POST vote
API -> Cosmos: Store vote
Cosmos --> API: Updated counts
API -> WS: Publish vote results
WS -> React: Updated percentages

group Failure handling
    alt Vision 429 or timeout
        VisionExecutor -> BroadcastExecutor: Skip window
    else Match Analyst failure
        AnalystNode -> BroadcastExecutor: Retain direct insight only
    else Decision-1 429 or timeout
        DecisionExecutor -> BroadcastExecutor: Suppress poll safely
    else Fan Engagement failure
        EngagementNode -> BroadcastExecutor: Retain direct insight only
    end
end

note over React,BroadcastExecutor
Playback continues during every workflow stage.
Seeking changes the generation, causing stale
workflow results to be discarded.
end note

@enduml
